From: hawkff <109485367+hawkff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:53:33 +0000
Subject: Download filter lists and components from the project site

The ad block filter lists came from uazo.github.io, the "Cromite
experimental filters" list from raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo, and the
component update manifest from uazo.github.io. All three now come from
one base address, defined as CROMITE_STATIC_FILES_URL in
components/cromite/static_files_url.h, with the same file names:

  filters/<list>.txt                  filter lists
  filters/experimental-cromite-filters.txt
  components/query4_0.json            component update manifest

The download address of the fonts pack comes from the manifest, so it
moves with the manifest.

The summary of the setting for snippets and other privileged filters
showed the address of one list. It now names the two lists that may use
privileged filters.

When the base address cannot be reached, installed lists stay in use.
A list that was never downloaded is retried with a growing delay of up
to one hour, and the component manifest is requested again at the next
component update check, every five hours.

